# The degree-518 tensor section, in its literal coordinates

Generated from `Binary/source/section518.json` by `source/generate_data.py`.
Bit j is column j. Kernel rows precede lifted rows; tensor coordinates are
`56*i+j`. The definitions below are data, not proofs of invariance or rank.
